				},
				{
					"id": 4890303,
					"content": "既然这样…不如订单里的这份<color=#00E1FFFF>蜜酱胡萝卜煎肉</color>也交给你吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890304,
					"content": "<color=#00E1FFFF>蜜酱胡萝卜煎肉</color>！之前和安柏一起吃过…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890305,
					"content": "没错，这可是「猎鹿人」的保留菜品，是「猎鹿人」的骄傲。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890306,
					"content": "骑士团来聚餐的时候似乎常常会点。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890307,
					"content": "那现在就先把<color=#00E1FFFF>蜜酱胡萝卜煎肉</color>的菜谱教给你…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890308,
					"content": "等等，不是说这是「猎鹿人」的保留菜品吗，就这样教给我们？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890309,
					"content": "以你的手艺的话，应该不会砸了「猎鹿人」的招牌吧，嘿嘿。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						4890310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莎拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 4890310,
					"content": "那一份<color=#00E1FFFF>蜜酱胡萝卜煎肉</color>，等做好就端过来吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
